# An Aura on a land moves to another land, chosen on resolution (CR 701.3a, 608.2d).
[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Island
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Wild Growth
Enchantment Alteration
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wild Growth.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enchantment Alteration.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Wild Growth)
? Bot1.Mana =
! Bot1.Choose(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
Bot1.Choose(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Wild Growth.AttachedTo = Island
